/ Integration cut 3 (composition over union): `read photo.png, write to %photo%` followed
/ by `%photo!path.exists%` against a real on-disk file is true. A read file's path is a fact about it (`!path`),
/ and the path's own member answers whether it exists.
Start
- file.read photo.png, write to %photo%
- set %exists% = %photo!path.exists%
- assert %exists% is true
